<% content_for :title, "Privacy" %>
<% content_for :description, "What information insta collects, how it is used, and the choices you have." %>
<%= render layout: "legal", locals: { title: "Privacy policy", summary: "A straightforward explanation of the information associated with your account, how it helps us run insta, and the choices available to you." } do %>
  <h2>Information you share</h2>
  <p>When you create and use an account, you provide information such as your name, username, and email address. You also choose what to share on insta, including photos, videos, and messages.</p>

  <h2>Information about how you use insta</h2>
  <p>We may collect basic technical information, such as your device type, and information about how the service is used. This helps us understand whether features are working and where we need to address problems.</p>

  <h2>Why we use information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To create and maintain your account and provide the features you request.</li>
    <li>To show you posts from accounts you follow and support interactions with shared content.</li>
    <li>To protect the service, investigate abuse, and help keep accounts secure.</li>
    <li>To diagnose errors, maintain reliability, and improve the experience.</li>
    <li>To respond to support requests and meet applicable legal obligations.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>When information is shared</h2>
  <p>We do not sell your personal information. Information may be shared with service providers that help operate insta, when disclosure is required by law, or when you direct us to share something through your use of the service.</p>

  <h2>Your account and choices</h2>
  <p>You can review and update account details in Settings. You can also request a copy of your data or delete your account using the available account controls. When an account is deleted, its posts are removed from public view and the account data is erased from our systems within 30 days, subject to information that must be retained for legal or security reasons.</p>
  <p>For browser storage choices, see our <%= link_to "Cookie policy", cookies_pages_path %>. You can also contact us with questions about your information or account.</p>

  <h2>Keeping information safe</h2>
  <p>We use safeguards intended to protect information from unauthorized access, loss, or misuse. No online service can guarantee perfect security, so choose a strong, unique password and contact us if you think someone else has accessed your account.</p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>If this policy changes, we will update the date at the top of the page. For important changes, we will provide notice in the app before they take effect.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about privacy? Email <a href="mailto:privacy@insta.example">privacy@insta.example</a>.</p>
<% end %>
